# Paths the PR reviewer skips — excluded from the MAX_ADDITIONS /
# MAX_CHANGED_FILES size gate and from the reviewer's context.
# See README.md § `.reviewignore`.

# Counterfeiter-generated fakes. Regenerated wholesale by `go generate`,
# never hand-edited, so there is nothing to review — and they are the
# largest single block in any PR that touches an interface.
mocks/

# dark-factory pipeline state (executed prompts, specs) — the code they
# produced is in the diff; the instructions are not code to review.
prompts/
specs/
